From 0eb7b3b7346f1c15e360e47f90f7827728514d73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LuK1337 <priv.luk@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:43:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: fusionlight: Support pre-V2.1 profiles

Profiles without SupportScreenshotAlgorithm_V2_1 use the older model:
per-segment R/G/B/W screen leakage polynomials scaled by a brightness
linearity and HAL *_VIEW_*_MAX calibration, with lux tables selected by
FusionLightBrightnesses segment. Previously these profiles were rejected.
Also match stock IR band selection and read SensorModuleId from the
profile.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I7a1cf46125ae09f2d51906091e72427dde51b406
---

